{"id":5071,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":510,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"036","content":"具体情况我稍后向您说明，现在优先处理眼前的危机。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"036","content":"我们小队会专注清理前方的敌人，启动主基站。过程中如果有敌人从后方偷袭，请您协助拦截，可以随时利用一切<color=#fb9259>辅助机关</color>。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"036","content":"另外——","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"他取出一个嵌着蓝光结晶的元件，放在你手中让你攥紧。","style":3,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"036","content":"这是单体用<color=#fb9259>狂厄屏蔽器</color>，里面的异方晶力场能暂时缓解枷锁带给您的精神压力，至少能让禁闭者恢复正常战斗状态。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"FAC队员","content":"队长！敌人来了，最近距离20米！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071006"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"036","content":"C队形，7秒后射击掩护！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"content":"他转向你，做最后的交代。","style":3,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"036","content":"记住，无论发生什么，不要被您的敌人动摇，也不要因为担忧我们而分心。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071009"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"036","content":"保护您是我们的职责，而您要做的只有保护好自己。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5071010"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"说完，他提起战斧，伴着枪声冲进敌群。","style":3,"background":506,"log_type":1}]}